tmux terminal multiplexer

Install:
  Install missing tmux and create a configuration with mouse support when ~/.tmux.conf is absent.

Upgrade:
  Update installed tmux and append the mouse-support setting to an existing configuration when the setting is absent.

Status:
  Report the installed package version and whether ~/.tmux.conf contains the mouse-support setting.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  Configuration file: ~/.tmux.conf
  Managed setting: set -g mouse on
  Install preserves existing configuration; upgrade preserves existing lines and does not create an absent configuration file.
